        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A striped rectangle rug is 50 × 80 cm of chunky cotton worked flat in double crochet with 4-row stripes in two colours. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "colour change",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "colour-change"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is worked on the final yarn-over of row 4 of each stripe. Carry the unused colour up the side edge to minimise ends. Chunky cotton gives a dense, padded rug that lies flat without blocking."
          }
        ]
      },
